MatRisk AI internship prototype

This repository was prepared as a student prototype around the supplied MatRisk AI project brief.
The brief states that project-related intellectual property is governed by Zetheta Algorithms
Private Limited's applicable participation/confidentiality terms. This file is informational and
is not a substitute for those terms or a separate software licence. Third-party libraries and
referenced datasets remain subject to their own licences and terms. Do not redistribute the
original assignment brief or sample data contrary to applicable instructions.
